title: "Medical Image Fusion: Fusion Paradigms, Clinical Applications, and Open Resources"
abstract: "A survey of multi-modality medical image fusion that organizes fusion paradigms through a three-axis taxonomy of input composition, fusion stage, and output purpose, and connects them with clinical applications, open resources, evaluation, and reproducibility requirements."
